      "title": "Usman Khawaja bunkers down as book tour ‘adjusted’ amid ball-tampering claims",
      "description": "<ul><li><p>Book tour will still go ahead but with changes this week’s schedule </p></li><li><p>Khawaja evasive when questioned on ABC’s 7:30 Report</p></li></ul><p>Usman Khawaja’s promotional book tour has been subject to “adjustments” after the former Australia Test batter was grilled about certain claims on the ABC’s 7.30 Report.</p><p>Khawaja pulled out of some radio and television spots on Wednesday, with his publisher Penguin saying that while the tour had not been cancelled entirely, changes had been made to his schedule this week.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/11/usman-khawaja-book-tour-adjusted-amid-ball-tampering-claims\">Continue reading...</a>",
