      "description": "<p>Three others critically injured and taken to hospitals as reports say car crashed into food stand in North Hollywood</p><p>At least three people are dead and three critically injured, after a car struck pedestrians on a Los Angeles corner during Tuesday rush hour, <a href=\"https://lafd.org/alert/autopedestrian-multifatality-11102026-inc1576\">authorities</a> said.</p><p>The fatal crash took place near a North Hollywood metro station.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/10/los-angeles-vehicle-crash\">Continue reading...</a>",
