      "id": "art-guardian_world-mwbmsbn3-5aly",
      "title": "Foo Fighters interrupt Sydney concert to pay tribute to Beaconsfield miner Todd Russell",
      "description": "<p>Dave Grohl tells Sydney crowd Russell, whose death was announced this week, was a ‘big’ hero of his</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/10/todd-russell-dies-beaconsfield-mine-collapse-survivor-death-illness-aged-54\">Todd Russell, Beaconsfield mine collapse survivor, dies aged 54 due to illness</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A solemn moment has broken up an otherwise raucous Foo Fighters Australian concert as the band’s frontman made a lengthy on-stage tribute to Beaconsfield survivor Todd Russell.</p><p>The US band are touring Australia for the 16th time in their 32-year history and Tuesday night’s Sydney show coincided with the news of Russell’s <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/10/todd-russell-dies-beaconsfield-mine-collapse-survivor-death-illness-aged-54\">death at the age of 54</a>.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/11/foo-fighters-dave-grohl-sydney-concert-tribute-beaconsfield-miner-todd-russell\">Continue reading...</a>",
