      "title": "Nima Momeni sentenced to 16 years to life in murder of Cash App founder Bob Lee",
      "description": "<p>Tech consultant convicted of second-degree murder in 2023 stabbing death of Cash App founder</p><p>Nima Momeni, the man convicted of murdering Cash App founder Bob Lee, has been sentenced to 16 years to life.</p><p>Momeni, 42, has been in San Francisco’s county jail since late April of 2023, after he was arrested in connection with the stabbing death of Lee, who had created the mobile payment service and was serving as the chief product officer of the cryptocurrency MobileCoin at the time of his death.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/10/bob-lee-cash-app-nima-momeni-sentenced\">Continue reading...</a>",
