      "quickSummary": [
        "Official verified dispatch from ScienceDaily: \"Astronomers discover hidden alien planet in James Webb images\".",
        "Key Context: A breakthrough in telescope imaging could reveal countless alien worlds that have been hiding in plain sight. Scientists developed a new technique that uses a digital twin of the James Webb Space Tele.",
