    {
      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mwbms7e2-y3e5",
      "title": "Noskova beats Gauff to reach WTA Finals semi-finals as Pegula stays alive",
      "description": "<ul><li><p>Czech defeats Gauff 6-3, 6-3 to reach last four</p></li><li><p>Pegula eliminates Kostyuk with straight-sets victory</p></li><li><p>Gauff and Pegula remain in contention for final berth</p></li></ul><p>Linda Noskova secured her place in the semi-finals of the WTA Finals with a 6-3, 6-3 victory over Coco Gauff on Tuesday, while Jessica Pegula knocked Marta Kostyuk out of the season-ending tournament with a straight-sets win.</p><p>The Czech, who beat Kostyuk in her opening match, has won both encounters without dropping a set and is assured of advancing to the knockout stage. Gauff and Pegula are both 1-1, with the final round-robin matches on Thursday set to determine who joins Noskova in the last four.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/10/jessica-pegula-marta-kostyuk-wta-finals-tennis\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/10/jessica-pegula-marta-kostyuk-wta-finals-tennis",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/10/jessica-pegula-marta-kostyuk-wta-finals-tennis",
      "publisherId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorName": "The Guardian Sport",
      "creatorHandle": "@guardiansport",
      "creatorAvatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461896836934-ffe607ba8211?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
      "platform": "news",
      "category": "Sports",
      "currentAffairsCategory": "Sports",
      "publishDate": "2026-11-10T23:31:32.000Z",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T23:31:32.000Z",
      "firstSeenAt": "2026-11-11T04:40:40.306Z",
      "lastCheckedAt": "2026-11-11T05:12:50.723Z",
      "contentHash": "0f01f073f3ac866f",
      "isUpdate": false,
      "readingTimeMinutes": 5,
      "thumbnailUrl": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d10a91562c516c692ea80a5961209205ca3c9501/337_0_3354_2685/master/3354.jpg?width=1000&amp%3Bquality=85&amp%3Bauto=format&amp%3Bfit=max&amp%3Bs=d744d0bea2f7d797d6f51be4bdc17a44&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max",
