      "quickSummary": [
        "Official verified dispatch from The Guardian Sport: \"Noskova beats Gauff to reach WTA Finals semi-finals as Pegula stays alive\".",
        "Key Context: <ul><li><p>Czech defeats Gauff 6-3, 6-3 to reach last four</p></li><li><p>Pegula eliminates Kostyuk with straight-sets victory</p></li><li><p>Gauff and Pegula remain in contention for final berth</p><.",
        "Categorized under Sports for global monitoring and reference.",
