      ],
      "easySummary": "<ul><li><p>Czech defeats Gauff 6-3, 6-3 to reach last four</p></li><li><p>Pegula eliminates Kostyuk with straight-sets victory</p></li><li><p>Gauff and Pegula remain in contention for final berth</p></li></ul><p>Linda Noskova secured her place in the semi-finals of the WTA Finals with a 6-3, 6-3 victory over Coco Gauff on Tuesday, while Jessica Pegula knocked Marta Kostyuk out of the season-ending tournament with a straight-sets win.</p><p>The Czech, who beat Kostyuk in her opening match, has won both encounters without dropping a set and is assured of advancing to the knockout stage. Gauff and Pegula are both 1-1, with the final round-robin matches on Thursday set to determine who joins Noskova in the last four.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/10/jessica-pegula-marta-kostyuk-wta-finals-tennis\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian Sport, this report highlights developments in Sports.\n\nHeadline: \"Noskova beats Gauff to reach WTA Finals semi-finals as Pegula stays alive\"\n\n<ul><li><p>Czech defeats Gauff 6-3, 6-3 to reach last four</p></li><li><p>Pegula eliminates Kostyuk with straight-sets victory</p></li><li><p>Gauff and Pegula remain in contention for final berth</p></li></ul><p>Linda Noskova secured her place in the semi-finals of the WTA Finals with a 6-3, 6-3 victory over Coco Gauff on Tuesday, while Jessica Pegula knocked Marta Kostyuk out of the season-ending tournament with a straight-sets win.</p><p>The Czech, who beat Kostyuk in her opening match, has won both encounters without dropping a set and is assured of advancing to the knockout stage. Gauff and Pegula are both 1-1, with the final round-robin matches on Thursday set to determine who joins Noskova in the last four.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/10/jessica-pegula-marta-kostyuk-wta-finals-tennis\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
