      "title": "Bombay High Court declines request for hearing each day in quota petitions for Maratha reservation",
      "description": "",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/maharashtra/bombay-high-court-declines-request-for-hearing-each-day-in-quota-petitions-for-maratha-reservation/article71687008.ece",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/maharashtra/bombay-high-court-declines-request-for-hearing-each-day-in-quota-petitions-for-maratha-reservation/article71687008.ece",
      "publisherId": "the_hindu_national",
