      "title": "Izzy Neale, ‘dearly loved’ Australian apprentice jockey, dies after fall at regional track",
      "description": "<ul><li><p>Twenty-two-year-old suffered severe injuries at race on Sunday</p></li><li><p>‘Words are not enough,’ says trainer Richard Freedman</p></li></ul><p>Apprentice jockey Izzy Neale has died following a fall at a regional racecourse.</p><p>Neale suffered severe injuries when her mount Marnoo fell entering the home straight in the Warren Shire Cotton Cup in NSW.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/11/izzy-neale-dies-race-fall-apprentice-jockey-death-track-racecourse\">Continue reading...</a>",
