      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mwbms7dy-vqlq",
      "title": "Fujino’s double sparks WCL comeback win for Manchester City against Inter",
      "description": "<p>On a very satisfying night for Manchester City, perhaps the most pleasing element was that they did not even need to call on Khadija ‘Bunny’ Shaw.</p><p>While giving their talismanic striker some precious rest, Manchester City’s European campaign finally came roaring into life as they put four goals past Inter to record their first Women’s Champions League victory of the season and greatly improve their prospects of reaching the knockout stages.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/nov/10/inter-manchester-city-womens-champions-league-match-report\">Continue reading...</a>",
