    {
      "id": "art-guardian_world-mwbmsbn4-cp6n",
      "title": "French police raid Ritz hotel in Mohamed Al Fayed sexual abuse investigation",
      "description": "<p>Arrests made after three properties were searched in relation to inquiry into late businessman</p><p>French police have made arrests after raiding three properties, including the <a href=\"https://www.ritzparis.com/\">Ritz hotel in Paris</a>, in relation to an investigation into sexual abuse and trafficking by Mohamed Al Fayed.</p><p>Several individuals were taken into custody for questioning last month and later released, according to the Paris public prosecutor’s office. Another property in Paris and one in Saint-Tropez, both with links to Fayed, were also searched in mid-October.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/10/french-police-raid-ritz-hotel-in-mohamed-al-fayed-sexual-abuse-investigation\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/10/french-police-raid-ritz-hotel-in-mohamed-al-fayed-sexual-abuse-investigation",
