      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mwbms7dy-kpq2",
      "title": "NFL trade deadline: Kirk Cousins returns to Vikings as Raiders hand starting job to Fernando Mendoza",
      "description": "<ul><li><p>Minnesota acquire veteran quarterback for 2027 pick</p></li><li><p>Cousins returns to Vikings after six seasons with team</p></li><li><p>No 1 pick Mendoza set to make first NFL start</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/live/2026/nov/10/nfl-trade-deadline-2026-live-updates-deals-rumors-news\">NFL trade deadline 2026 – as it happened</a></p></li></ul><p>Kirk Cousins is heading back to Minnesota.</p><p>The Vikings have acquired the veteran quarterback from the Las Vegas Raiders in exchange for a third-round pick in the 2027 draft, according to multiple reports, including from <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50444360/sources-vikings-id-qb-kirk-cousins-prime-trade-target\">ESPN’s Adam Schefter</a> and <a href=\"https://x.com/RapSheet/status/2120239208153391224\">NFL Network’s Ian Rapoport</a>.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/10/kirk-cousins-minnesota-vikings-las-vegas-raiders-trade-fernando-mendoza\">Continue reading...</a>",
