      "description": "<ul><li><p>Coach’s contract has release clause of about $10m</p></li><li><p>United expected to sack Michael Carrick after awful start</p></li></ul><p>US men’s national team head coach Mauricio Pochettino is interested in a move to Manchester United, multiple sources told the Guardian, with those same sources characterizing the interest as mutual.</p><p>United are <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/nov/10/manchester-united-jason-wilcox-omar-berrada-jim-ratcliffe-michael-carrick-should-be-sacked\">expected to sack</a> their head coach, Michael Carrick, after a disastrous start to their season which leaves them at risk of relegation from the Premier League, their worst opening to a campaign in four decades.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/nov/10/mauricio-pochettino-interested-manchester-united-usmnt-release-clause\">Continue reading...</a>",
