    {
      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mwbms7e0-44ta",
      "title": "Hot mics, Andreeva ‘diva’ drama and a stopgap finale at Indian Wells bail out the WTA | Tumaini Carayol",
      "description": "<p>Finals have hit California desert after a stormy few years and pre-tournament kerfuffle has added to the fun</p><p>Towards the end of a positive day for Mirra Andreeva, one of the brightest young stars of women’s tennis, the 19-year-old approached the broadcast cameras to dissect her excellent 6-4, 6-0 win against Elina Svitolina in her first match at this year’s WTA Finals. Andreeva took her place alongside Madison Keys, the 2025 Australian Open champion and a guest reporter for Sky Sports at Indian Wells, who greeted her with a mischievous smile. “Hey, diva!” Keys said.</p><p>This was an obvious reference to the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/05/wta-finals-jessica-pegula-mirra-andreeva-hot-mic-diva-apology\">kerfuffle on the eve of the tournament</a> when Jessica Pegula, known usually as one of the most congenial players on the tour, had been caught on a hot mic delivering a series of stinging criticisms of Andreeva in a private conversation with her coach. Pegula, who had just finished a practice set with an angsty Andreeva, described her rival as a “diva” who “needs to be humbled”. Her comments spread instantly to all corners of the internet.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/10/hot-mics-andreeva-diva-drama-and-a-stopgap-finale-at-indian-wells-bail-out-the-wta\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/10/hot-mics-andreeva-diva-drama-and-a-stopgap-finale-at-indian-wells-bail-out-the-wta",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/10/hot-mics-andreeva-diva-drama-and-a-stopgap-finale-at-indian-wells-bail-out-the-wta",
      "publisherId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorName": "The Guardian Sport",
      "creatorHandle": "@guardiansport",
      "creatorAvatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461896836934-ffe607ba8211?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
