      "title": "Paleontologists discover “one-in-a-million” fossil with 450-million-year-old soft tissue",
      "description": "Scientists have discovered a remarkably preserved 450-million-year-old fossil containing soft tissues from an ancient starfish relative, revealing unexpected details about marine life more than 200 million years before dinosaurs existed. Found in a museum collection, the extraordinarily rare specimen offers new clues about how Earth&#039;s earliest reef animals fed, survived, and evolved.",
