    {
      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mwbms7e2-qecy",
      "title": "Rui Pinto’s lawyers in talks with UK authorities over deal for Manchester City whistleblower",
      "description": "<ul><li><p>Serious Fraud Office has contacted Pinto</p></li><li><p>He is willing to assist in exchange for protection</p></li></ul><p>Rui Pinto’s lawyers are in talks with British authorities over a potential cooperation agreement under which the Manchester City whistleblower could help to expose serious financial and sporting crime in the UK.</p><p>According to information obtained by the Guardian, the Serious Fraud Office has contacted Pinto after it emerged he was <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/03/manchester-city-whistleblower-rui-pinto-ready-to-help-uk-authorities-in-return-for-protection\">willing to assist British authorities</a> with their investigations in exchange for protection.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/nov/10/rui-pinto-lawyers-talks-uk-authorities-cooperation-deal-whistleblower\">Continue reading...</a>",
