      "title": "After 40 years, CERN finds evidence of a one-in-10-billion particle decay",
      "description": "CERN scientists have finally found evidence of a particle decay so rare that it happens only once in roughly 10 billion decays, ending a search spanning more than 40 years. The breakthrough could help physicists uncover hidden particles and forces that lie beyond the reach of today&#039;s most powerful accelerators.",
