      "detailedSummary": "Published by BBC Technology, this report highlights developments in Technology.\n\nHeadline: \"Zoe Kleinman: Nvidia CEO's affair will cause ripples across US and beyond\"\n\nJensen Huang is being investigated by his own company over an extramarital affair with a woman alleged to be a Chinese spy.\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
