    {
      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mwbms7e3-fqbl",
      "title": "‘Senna was Senna’: Wolff says it is too soon to compare Kimi Antonelli to F1 great",
      "description": "<ul><li><p>World champion idolises Brazilian who won three titles</p></li><li><p>‘He’s a Senninha and not a Senna yet,’ says Toto Wolff</p></li></ul><p>Toto Wolff says it is too soon to compare his world champion driver Kimi Antonelli to Ayrton Senna but that the Italian may yet develop into a driver comparable to the Brazilian great whom Antonelli grew up idolising.</p><p>Antonelli sealed his first Formula One world championship at the Mexican Grand Prix and with a fifth place <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/08/lando-norris-wins-f1-sao-paulo-grand-prix-max-verstappen-kimi-antonelli-lewis-hamilton-mercedes\">at Sunday’s São Paulo Grand Prix</a> helped Mercedes secure their ninth constructors’ championship and their first drivers’ and constructors’ double since 2020.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/09/senna-was-senna-wolff-says-it-is-too-soon-to-compare-kimi-antonelli-to-f1-great\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/09/senna-was-senna-wolff-says-it-is-too-soon-to-compare-kimi-antonelli-to-f1-great",
