      "id": "art-mit_tech_review-mwbms9h1-aqgs",
      "title": "The climate case for AI has not been made",
      "description": "This week, as countries meet in Antalya, Turkey for the United Nations climate conference, one topic likely to dominate the conversation is artificial intelligence. The host has already called on countries to commit to ensuring that AI is designed, powered, and deployed in ways that support climate action. But so far, industries around the world&#8230;",
