      "title": "DNA on the Shroud of Turin reveals centuries of hidden secrets",
      "description": "The Shroud of Turin, one of history&#039;s most mysterious religious artifacts, is yielding surprising new clues through DNA analysis. Scientists have uncovered a complex mixture of biological traces that may reveal more about the cloth&#039;s past and the environments it encountered. The findings offer a fresh scientific perspective on a centuries-old mystery that continues to spark fascination and debate.",
