      "id": "art-guardian_environment-mwbmsbtb-ecxw",
      "title": "Heavy rain floods displaced families’ tents in Gaza – in pictures",
      "description": "<p>The first winter storm began affecting the people of Gaza this weekend with heavy rain hitting on Saturday. Reports that about 70,000 tents were flooded within 12 hours prompted warnings of a worsening humanitarian situation for hundreds of thousands of displaced people living in temporary camps lacking adequate protection from rain and cold</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/gallery/2026/nov/08/heavy-rain-floods-displaced-families-tents-gaza-in-pictures\">Continue reading...</a>",
