      "id": "art-guardian_environment-mwbmsbtb-olc6",
      "title": "The tiny world of Australian fairywrens – in pictures",
      "description": "<p>Howard Loosemore, alongside a few talented photographer friends, spent 15 years capturing every Australian fairywren species and plumage in vivid detail that’s been published in a <a href=\"https://uwap.uwa.edu.au/products/the-fairywrens-of-australia\">new book</a> about the small and colourful lives of fairywrens</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/environment/gallery/2026/nov/09/the-tiny-world-of-australian-fairy-wrens-howard-loosmore-photography\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/gallery/2026/nov/09/the-tiny-world-of-australian-fairy-wrens-howard-loosmore-photography",
