        "Official verified dispatch from Vox News & Explains: \"Why animals are smarter than we think\".",
        "Key Context: When I was growing up, one of my favorite things to hear from an adult was that I was smart. It made me feel special — like I was capable of doing things that other people weren’t. In hindsight, that .",
