      "id": "art-wired-mwbms80v-3bls",
      "title": "I Used NYT Cooking’s New AI-Powered Recipe Modifier, and It’s Actually Pretty Good",
      "description": "The New York Times has added a beta feature to its Cooking app that helps readers swap ingredients or adjust recipes to suit their needs. It mostly hits the mark.",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.wired.com/story/nyt-cooking-new-ai-powered-recipe-modifier-is-pretty-good",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.wired.com/story/nyt-cooking-new-ai-powered-recipe-modifier-is-pretty-good/",
