tspoken election denier in charge of the state’s voting system. More from Vox: How election officials are thinking about Trump’s threat to the midterms The one thing everyone can do to fight for free and fair elections Trump has a plan to steal the midterms. It will probably fail. One link for later ➨ Turn on the (early morning) lights. It’s getting darker earlier and earlier these days, and it’s often pitch black when my alarm goes off. That means it’s time for an annual tradition: digging out my bulky, 10,000-lux light box. Bright morning light, from a box or the sun, sets your body’s internal clock and helps regulate your sleep . It can also mitigate seasonal affective disorder, which starts plaguing many sufferers around Halloween. Before you go… Did you know… that there’s an extremely rare and spooky form of lightning that can appear indoors? It’s called “ball lightning,” and it’s one of the most mysterious weather phenomena in the world. Today’s trivia: What’s the name of the vast Andean empire that ruled from its capital in Cusco? (You can find this and other brain puzzles in Vox’s daily crossword . Look for the answer in tomorrow’s edition.) Yesterday’s trivia: Yesterday we asked you where you might find an arroyo. These seasonally dry streambeds cut through deserts, where they can serve as a “highway” for wild animals.",
