        "Original reporting published by The Guardian Sport. Direct canonical dispatch linked."
      ],
      "easySummary": "<ul><li><p>Mexican star wins unanimous decision over Mbilli</p></li><li><p>Álvarez, 36, regains WBC title after Crawford defeat</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/live/2026/oct/31/canelo-alvarez-v-christian-mbilli-wbc-super-middleweight-championship-live-buildup\">Read Bryan Armen Graham’s round-by-round report</a></p></li></ul><p>Mexico’s Saúl “Canelo” Álvarez reclaimed the WBC super-middleweight title with a unanimous-decision victory over the previously unbeaten Christian Mbilli in Riyadh on Saturday night.</p><p>The fight went ahead at Kingdom Arena despite a week of heightened security concerns in the Saudi capital, where the Saudi-led coalition said it had intercepted missiles and drones launched by Iran-aligned Houthi forces. Several events in the kingdom were cancelled or postponed, including the Six Kings Slam tennis exhibition.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/canelo-alvarez-christian-mbilli-wbc-world-title-riyadh-boxing\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian Sport, this report highlights developments in Sports.\n\nHeadline: \"Canelo Álvarez wins back world title as Houthi attacks cast shadow over Riyadh\"\n\n<ul><li><p>Mexican star wins unanimous decision over Mbilli</p></li><li><p>Álvarez, 36, regains WBC title after Crawford defeat</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/live/2026/oct/31/canelo-alvarez-v-christian-mbilli-wbc-super-middleweight-championship-live-buildup\">Read Bryan Armen Graham’s round-by-round report</a></p></li></ul><p>Mexico’s Saúl “Canelo” Álvarez reclaimed the WBC super-middleweight title with a unanimous-decision victory over the previously unbeaten Christian Mbilli in Riyadh on Saturday night.</p><p>The fight went ahead at Kingdom Arena despite a week of heightened security concerns in the Saudi capital, where the Saudi-led coalition said it had intercepted missiles and drones launched by Iran-aligned Houthi forces. Several events in the kingdom were cancelled or postponed, including the Six Kings Slam tennis exhibition.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/canelo-alvarez-christian-mbilli-wbc-world-title-riyadh-boxing\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
