      "easySummary": "<ul><li><p>Northampton 28-14 Gloucester</p></li><li><p>Alex Mitchell limps off with suspected hamstring pull</p></li></ul><p>England’s injury headaches are mounting before next Sunday’s autumn opener against Australia with the scrum-half Alex Mitchell a major doubt after limping out of Northampton’s hard-fought victory over Gloucester with another hamstring problem.</p><p>It is to the credit of Northampton that they weathered that setback, withheld Gloucester’s early onslaught to score 28 unanswered points and see off the early-season pace-setters. Northampton’s last league outing here ended with <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/10/northampton-bath-prem-rugby-union-match-report\">119 points scored</a> but this was a victory founded on their defensive resilience with Tom Pearson, back in the England picture this autumn, outstanding throughout.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/northampton-gloucester-prem-rugby-union-match-report\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian Sport, this report highlights developments in Sports.\n\nHeadline: \"Mitchell injury blow adds to England’s woes as Northampton sink Gloucester\"\n\n<ul><li><p>Northampton 28-14 Gloucester</p></li><li><p>Alex Mitchell limps off with suspected hamstring pull</p></li></ul><p>England’s injury headaches are mounting before next Sunday’s autumn opener against Australia with the scrum-half Alex Mitchell a major doubt after limping out of Northampton’s hard-fought victory over Gloucester with another hamstring problem.</p><p>It is to the credit of Northampton that they weathered that setback, withheld Gloucester’s early onslaught to score 28 unanswered points and see off the early-season pace-setters. Northampton’s last league outing here ended with <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/10/northampton-bath-prem-rugby-union-match-report\">119 points scored</a> but this was a victory founded on their defensive resilience with Tom Pearson, back in the England picture this autumn, outstanding throughout.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/northampton-gloucester-prem-rugby-union-match-report\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
