      "originalImageUrl": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/d6a6c7df63cfcb256c9b9b2a5c319a0f23dbd3f1/213_48_2185_1748/master/2185.jpg?width=1000&amp%3Bquality=85&amp%3Bauto=format&amp%3Bfit=max&amp%3Bs=99820e127b8958024fff50f4cee7c2fd&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max",
