      "originalImageUrl": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/ee3efefa4a3d1ae01d7d47bd2f4d5511d91d546a/244_173_2403_1923/master/2403.jpg?width=1000&amp%3Bquality=85&amp%3Bauto=format&amp%3Bfit=max&amp%3Bs=7353b0bddc239b41717ead7a15622db3&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max",
