    {
      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mvxd1lhn-tnqe",
      "title": "Pakistan win tri-series final as Fakhar Zaman century denies Sri Lanka in thrilling chase",
      "description": "<ul><li><p>Opener scores 127 from 99 balls in Lahore</p></li><li><p>Kamindu Mendis’s 131 proves in vain for Sri Lanka</p></li></ul><p>This mini-tournament has been a welcome change of pace, carrying more meaning than your bog-standard three-match white-ball slog between two teams. And then there’s the gift of a final. This was a fitting conclusion under the lights in a packed-out Gaddafi Stadium in Lahore, settled in the penultimate over as Pakistan beat Sri Lanka by three wickets to win the tri-series.</p><p>Fakhar Zaman, Pakistan’s hero from the 2017 Champions Trophy final, crashed his way to 127 in a chase of 326. But plenty of work remained after his dismissal, and the new boys needed to stay calm. Arafat Minhas, 21, and Hasan Nawaz, 24, played like old-timers, their partnership of 94 securing the game. Minhas and Faheem Ashraf fell with two runs still required, but Shaheen Afridi finished the evening with a wallop over the ropes.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/pakistan-sri-lanka-tri-series-final\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/pakistan-sri-lanka-tri-series-final",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/pakistan-sri-lanka-tri-series-final",
      "publisherId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorName": "The Guardian Sport",
      "creatorHandle": "@guardiansport",
      "creatorAvatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461896836934-ffe607ba8211?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
      "platform": "news",
      "category": "Sports",
      "currentAffairsCategory": "Sports",
      "publishDate": "2026-10-31T16:46:30.000Z",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-31T16:46:30.000Z",
      "firstSeenAt": "2026-11-01T04:59:15.864Z",
      "lastCheckedAt": "2026-11-01T05:06:57.163Z",
      "contentHash": "d20cd440b173cefd",
      "isUpdate": false,
      "readingTimeMinutes": 5,
