        "Categorized under Current Affairs for global monitoring and reference.",
        "Original reporting published by The Guardian World. Direct canonical dispatch linked."
      ],
      "easySummary": "<p>Record number of early votes cast, with Democrats outnumbering Republicans in states which collect that information</p><p>There has been a surge of early voting for the US midterm elections, with millions more Americans going to the polls compared with the last such election amid a series of tight contests that will determine control of Congress.</p><p>More than 50.5m early votes have been cast across the US as of Saturday morning, <a href=\"https://election.lab.ufl.edu/early-vote/2026-early-voting/\">according to an analysis by the University of Florida</a>. This is already nearly 5m more votes than the total number of early votes made in the last midterm elections, in 2022.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/31/early-voting-midterms\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian World, this report highlights developments in World News.\n\nHeadline: \"More than 50m Americans cast ballots in early voting with three days to go before midterms\"\n\n<p>Record number of early votes cast, with Democrats outnumbering Republicans in states which collect that information</p><p>There has been a surge of early voting for the US midterm elections, with millions more Americans going to the polls compared with the last such election amid a series of tight contests that will determine control of Congress.</p><p>More than 50.5m early votes have been cast across the US as of Saturday morning, <a href=\"https://election.lab.ufl.edu/early-vote/2026-early-voting/\">according to an analysis by the University of Florida</a>. This is already nearly 5m more votes than the total number of early votes made in the last midterm elections, in 2022.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/31/early-voting-midterms\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
