        "Categorized under Current Affairs for global monitoring and reference.",
        "Original reporting published by The Guardian World. Direct canonical dispatch linked."
      ],
      "easySummary": "<p>But select Democrats, too, are being accused of having ties to the late sex offender as country prepares to vote</p><p>In races across the country, Democratic candidates or groups that support them have released ads accusing <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/republicans\">Republicans</a> of protecting pedophiles by voting against legislation to release files related to <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/jeffrey-epstein\">Jeffrey Epstein</a>.</p><p>The ads appear intended to <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/22/trump-epstein-tucker-carlson-turning-point-usa\">evoke an emotional response </a>by accusing candidates of “protecting” Epstein, a notorious pedophile accused of running a sex-trafficking ring involving minors.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/31/political-ads-midterms-epstein-republican-candidate\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian World, this report highlights developments in World News.\n\nHeadline: \"Ads accusing Republican candidates of protecting Epstein fill airwaves in final midterm push\"\n\n<p>But select Democrats, too, are being accused of having ties to the late sex offender as country prepares to vote</p><p>In races across the country, Democratic candidates or groups that support them have released ads accusing <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/republicans\">Republicans</a> of protecting pedophiles by voting against legislation to release files related to <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/jeffrey-epstein\">Jeffrey Epstein</a>.</p><p>The ads appear intended to <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/22/trump-epstein-tucker-carlson-turning-point-usa\">evoke an emotional response </a>by accusing candidates of “protecting” Epstein, a notorious pedophile accused of running a sex-trafficking ring involving minors.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/31/political-ads-midterms-epstein-republican-candidate\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
