    {
      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mvxd1lhr-zeaw",
      "title": "Fallon Sherrock pulls off shock defeat of world darts No 1 Luke Littler in live TV battle",
      "description": "<p>The 15th amateur to challenge Littler in Netflix stream on Friday evening, Sherrock was ‘lost for words’ after winning £501,000 prize</p><p>The name of the programme was Beat Luke Littler and Fallon Sherrock did just that.</p><p>On one of the biggest nights of the year for British TV and Netflix, there was much at stake: not just £501,000 to any of the 20 amateur challengers who managed to beat Littler in a single leg of darts, but also the jeopardy of whether audiences would choose to watch the streamer’s first UK live entertainment event – or the final of BBC juggernaut The Celebrity Traitors.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/fallon-sherrock-shock-defeat-luke-littler-darts-live-tv-battle-netflix\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/fallon-sherrock-shock-defeat-luke-littler-darts-live-tv-battle-netflix",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/fallon-sherrock-shock-defeat-luke-littler-darts-live-tv-battle-netflix",
      "publisherId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorName": "The Guardian Sport",
      "creatorHandle": "@guardiansport",
      "creatorAvatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461896836934-ffe607ba8211?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
      "platform": "news",
