        "Official verified dispatch from The Guardian Sport: \"Fallon Sherrock pulls off shock defeat of world darts No 1 Luke Littler in live TV battle\".",
        "Key Context: <p>The 15th amateur to challenge Littler in Netflix stream on Friday evening, Sherrock was ‘lost for words’ after winning £501,000 prize</p><p>The name of the programme was Beat Luke Littler and Fallo.",
