        "Original reporting published by The Guardian Sport. Direct canonical dispatch linked."
      ],
      "easySummary": "<p>The 15th amateur to challenge Littler in Netflix stream on Friday evening, Sherrock was ‘lost for words’ after winning £501,000 prize</p><p>The name of the programme was Beat Luke Littler and Fallon Sherrock did just that.</p><p>On one of the biggest nights of the year for British TV and Netflix, there was much at stake: not just £501,000 to any of the 20 amateur challengers who managed to beat Littler in a single leg of darts, but also the jeopardy of whether audiences would choose to watch the streamer’s first UK live entertainment event – or the final of BBC juggernaut The Celebrity Traitors.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/fallon-sherrock-shock-defeat-luke-littler-darts-live-tv-battle-netflix\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian Sport, this report highlights developments in Sports.\n\nHeadline: \"Fallon Sherrock pulls off shock defeat of world darts No 1 Luke Littler in live TV battle\"\n\n<p>The 15th amateur to challenge Littler in Netflix stream on Friday evening, Sherrock was ‘lost for words’ after winning £501,000 prize</p><p>The name of the programme was Beat Luke Littler and Fallon Sherrock did just that.</p><p>On one of the biggest nights of the year for British TV and Netflix, there was much at stake: not just £501,000 to any of the 20 amateur challengers who managed to beat Littler in a single leg of darts, but also the jeopardy of whether audiences would choose to watch the streamer’s first UK live entertainment event – or the final of BBC juggernaut The Celebrity Traitors.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/31/fallon-sherrock-shock-defeat-luke-littler-darts-live-tv-battle-netflix\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
