      "originalImageUrl": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5f49985c17c11d89f3126df677fb481daf5747ce/75_0_2625_2100/master/2625.jpg?width=1000&amp%3Bquality=85&amp%3Bauto=format&amp%3Bfit=max&amp%3Bs=e5d9ddcb98b71b6a764f2d6c07328212&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max",
