      "originalImageUrl": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/4d79eebb869add31c28b2d268e4200befc0b7159/294_0_2952_2362/master/2952.jpg?width=1000&amp%3Bquality=85&amp%3Bauto=format&amp%3Bfit=max&amp%3Bs=a3ecbe09f8038f0c49c99305814efc49&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max",
