      "easySummary": "<p>Voters are feeling the pinch of Trump’s anti-climate agenda as energy costs rise, but a shake-up in Congress could shift things</p><p>If the polls can be believed, the US could see a blue wave in the midterms, giving Democrats a chance to take back the House and Senate, and gaining <a href=\"https://www.cookpolitical.com/analysis/governors/2026-final-governors-ratings\">up to four</a> governor’s seats.</p><p>These wins could give Democrats new power to resist Donald Trump’s anti-climate agenda, and to push forward climate policies at the state level. But if Republicans maintain power, it could further embolden Trump’s “drill, baby, drill” agenda and leave intact his administration’s latitude to continue dismantling regulatory measures his critics say protect public health and the planet.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/30/climate-crisis-midterms-affordability\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian Environment, this report highlights developments in Science and Environment.\n\nHeadline: \"Five reasons why the US midterms matter for the climate – and your energy bill\"\n\n<p>Voters are feeling the pinch of Trump’s anti-climate agenda as energy costs rise, but a shake-up in Congress could shift things</p><p>If the polls can be believed, the US could see a blue wave in the midterms, giving Democrats a chance to take back the House and Senate, and gaining <a href=\"https://www.cookpolitical.com/analysis/governors/2026-final-governors-ratings\">up to four</a> governor’s seats.</p><p>These wins could give Democrats new power to resist Donald Trump’s anti-climate agenda, and to push forward climate policies at the state level. But if Republicans maintain power, it could further embolden Trump’s “drill, baby, drill” agenda and leave intact his administration’s latitude to continue dismantling regulatory measures his critics say protect public health and the planet.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/30/climate-crisis-midterms-affordability\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
