    {
      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mvxd1lht-uhyg",
      "title": "‘It’s just USA, blah, blah, blah’: Rising rugby star Bella Vogel out to catch wounded England napping",
      "description": "<p>The Pennsylvania center found rugby early and is nominated for World Rugby Breakthrough Player of the Year. In New Jersey, the Red Roses will present her stiffest Test yet</p><p>Going into their WXV Global Series game against England’s world champion Red Roses in Harrison, New Jersey, on Friday, the US Eagles women have five successive wins and a squad mixing great experience with great youth. Among potentially great younger players is the first American ever nominated for a major World Rugby award.</p><p>“I keep getting told like, ‘Oh, don’t let your head get too big,’” laughed Bella Vogel, the 19-year-old center or fly-half from Washington Boro, Pennsylvania, <a href=\"https://www.world.rugby/news/1048670/world-rugby-reveals-womens-15s-player-breakthrough-player-and-try-of-the-year-nominees-for-2026\">nominated</a> for Women’s 15s Breakthrough Player of the Year. Still a student at <a href=\"https://liferunningeagles.com/sports/womens-rugby\">Life University in Marietta, Georgia</a>, she has had an extraordinary season.</p><p><em>USA v England and USA men v Australia XV will be broadcast in the US <a href=\"https://www.paramountplus.com/shows/world-rugby/\">on Paramount Plus</a> and in the UK on the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/zOgdpIbL9a0\">England Rugby YouTube channel</a> and <a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer\">BBC iPlayer</a>.</em></p><p><em>Martin Pengelly writes about rugby in the US on Substack, at <a href=\"https://thenationalmaul.substack.com/\">The National Maul</a>.</em></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/30/bella-vogel-usa-rugby\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/30/bella-vogel-usa-rugby",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/30/bella-vogel-usa-rugby",
      "publisherId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorName": "The Guardian Sport",
      "creatorHandle": "@guardiansport",
      "creatorAvatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461896836934-ffe607ba8211?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
      "platform": "news",
