      "originalImageUrl": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/4b8061be068d0c34f7875e002f51ed5bc5855c91/299_0_2102_1682/master/2102.jpg?width=1000&amp%3Bquality=85&amp%3Bauto=format&amp%3Bfit=max&amp%3Bs=7d5e04a65fae36a35be7d35843425ab3&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max",
