      "easySummary": "Scientists have identified a weakened brain signal that may connect several seemingly unrelated symptoms of schizophrenia, including sensory processing difficulties, disorganized speech, and greater symptom severity. The surprising discovery could help explain the disorder&#039;s underlying mechanisms and potentially lead to earlier detection and new treatments.",
