      "id": "art-guardian_world-mvpeg0ps-0ct8",
      "title": "Trump intensifies anti-Muslim rhetoric against Abdul El-Sayed at Michigan rally – US politics live",
      "description": "<p>The US president was condemned for remarks that questioned the senate candidate’s loyalty to the country</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/26/what-are-midterm-elections\">What are the US midterm elections and why do they matter?</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/feb/17/sign-up-for-the-breaking-news-us-email-to-get-newsletter-alerts-direct-to-your-inbox?utm_medium=ACQUISITIONS_STANDFIRST&amp;utm_campaign=BN22326&amp;utm_content=signup&amp;utm_term=standfirst&amp;utm_source=GUARDIAN_WEB\">Sign up for Breaking News US email</a></p></li></ul><p>Abdul El-Sayed, the Democratic US Senate candidate, started his day on the campaign trail in Escanaba, Michigan, where nearby Wisconsin dairy country spills into dense forests and the sandy shores of Green Bay.</p><p>This is the upper peninsula – the “UP” – a rural slash of land north of Michigan’s mitt. Electorally, it’s crimson. Donald Trump won some districts near Escanaba by more than 41%. But at the county fairgrounds, past sheds labeled “Beef” and “Swine”, hundreds of locals on the political left have gathered in the hangar-size 4H Club meeting hall to hear El-Sayed speak.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/26/donald-trump-abdul-el-sayed-midterms-michigan-rally-space-latest-us-politics-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/26/donald-trump-abdul-el-sayed-midterms-michigan-rally-space-latest-us-politics-news-updates",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/26/donald-trump-abdul-el-sayed-midterms-michigan-rally-space-latest-us-politics-news-updates",
