      "id": "art-guardian_world-mvpeg0pr-7259",
      "title": "Russell Brand had ‘insane sexual appetite’ and bad behaviour on ‘another level’, trial told",
      "description": "<p>Brand, charged with rape and sexual assault, was ‘sleeping with people day and night’, former assistant alleges</p><p>Russell Brand had an “insane sexual appetite” and his bad behaviour was on “another level” to that of other celebrities, his former personal assistant has told a court.</p><p>Helen Berger told police she had seen Brand treat women badly and that she once had to stop his mother and girlfriend walking in on him having sex with someone in his dressing room.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/26/russell-brand-trial-personal-assistant-evidence\">Continue reading...</a>",
