      "id": "art-guardian_world-mvpeg0ps-4fri",
      "title": "NHS consultants to go on two-day strike in England in November, says BMA",
      "description": "<p>Industrial action by senior doctors to begin on 25 November with only emergency cover provided, union says</p><p>England’s most senior hospital doctors will strike next month in a dispute over their pay and hours, prompting NHS bosses to warn that patients will suffer “pain, discomfort and inconvenience”.</p><p>Consultant doctors, who currently earn an average of £152,000 a year, will stage a two-day walkout on 25 and 26 November, as hospitals gear up for the extra pressures winter brings.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/society/2026/oct/26/nhs-consultants-two-day-doctors-strike-england-november-bma\">Continue reading...</a>",
