      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian Sport, this report highlights developments in Sports.\n\nHeadline: \"Liam Dawson reveals England are ‘gutted’ after ODI series setback against Pakistan\"\n\n<ul><li><p>‘We were desperate to win’</p></li><li><p>Spinner believes defeats are useful learning experiences</p></li></ul><p>Liam Dawson has revealed England’s disappointment after the two ­agonising defeats <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/22/sri-lanka-england-odi-match-report-brook-202\">to Sri Lanka </a><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/25/england-pakistan-odi-match-report-cricket-shadab-khan\">and Pakistan</a> that have left making the ODI tri-series final is in serious doubt. “That ­changing room is gutted, we’re desperate to win,” he said.</p><p>To reach the final, England need Pakistan to beat Sri Lanka on Tuesday and then they have to thrash Sri Lanka on Thursday, but Dawson is optimistic the losses can be help them in the World Cup in 12 months’ time in southern Africa.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/26/liam-dawson-reveals-england-cricket-squad-gutted-after-second-odi-series-catastrophe\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
