      "title": "Sudan paramilitary drone strikes cause mass power cuts in eastern states",
      "description": "<p>Rapid Support Forces strike five power stations in three states controlled by Sudanese army</p><p>Sudan’s paramilitary Rapid Support Forces have launched a coordinated drone attack against five power stations, causing mass power outages across the country’s east, a government official said.</p><p>The drones hit two power stations each in the states of Al-Jazira and Gedaref and one in White Nile state, “resulting in power outages across large parts of these three states”, the official said on condition of anonymity.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/26/sudan-paramilitary-drone-strikes-rapid-support-forces-power-cuts-eastern-states\">Continue reading...</a>",
