      "id": "art-guardian_world-mvpeg0pn-xy0q",
      "title": "Man found dead in Queensland flood waters as state hit by multiple storms and days-long deluge",
      "description": "<p>Many rivers and roads left flooded after torrential downpours across Queensland</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A man’s body has been found in flood waters following an unusual weather system that delivered multiple storms and a days-long deluge to parts of Australia.</p><p>Emergency services were called to a creek at Boompa on Queensland’s Fraser Coast shortly after 11am on Monday after reports a man had been found unresponsive.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/26/man-found-dead-in-queensland-floodwaters-as-state-hit-by-days-long-deluge\">Continue reading...</a>",
