      "easySummary": "<p>Calculations from the Center for Global Development say spending next year is likely to be £410m less than anticipated</p><p>The UK is on course to miss its target of spending 0.3% of national income on international aid by an estimated £400m by the end of next year.</p><p>Calculations from the Center for Global Development (CGD) found the UK was on course for a large shortfall in promised official development assistance at the end of 2027.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/oct/26/uk-international-aid-target-spending-shortfall-budget-research\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian World, this report highlights developments in World News.\n\nHeadline: \"UK poised to miss reduced aid spending target of 0.3% of national income\"\n\n<p>Calculations from the Center for Global Development say spending next year is likely to be £410m less than anticipated</p><p>The UK is on course to miss its target of spending 0.3% of national income on international aid by an estimated £400m by the end of next year.</p><p>Calculations from the Center for Global Development (CGD) found the UK was on course for a large shortfall in promised official development assistance at the end of 2027.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/oct/26/uk-international-aid-target-spending-shortfall-budget-research\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
