      "originalImageUrl": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/1106bb4a8ba03a7902cd91e87de8ac9bf5fd7fb3/540_0_4164_3333/master/4164.jpg?width=1000&amp%3Bquality=85&amp%3Bauto=format&amp%3Bfit=max&amp%3Bs=e82e9d2735077a56f93f5caae8287601&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max",
