      "description": "<ul><li><p>Opener played through pain to establish himself as a Test cricketer</p></li><li><p>‘I didn’t want anyone to use it against me,’ he says</p></li></ul><p>Usman Khawaja has opened up on why he kept the rheumatoid arthritis that threatened his playing future a secret for his entire Test career.</p><p>The former Test star releases his autobiography, Sabr, on 10 November, which he said he wrote “for people who do love cricket and for those who don’t”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/26/usman-khawaja-reveals-why-he-kept-rheumatoid-arthritis-secret\">Continue reading...</a>",
