      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mvpccgs7-8nws",
      "title": "NFL roundup: Seahawks overwhelm Chiefs to end KC’s unbeaten run",
      "description": "<ul><li><p>Bucs rout Panthers in Baker Mayfield’s return</p></li><li><p>Browns move to 5-2 with late win over Titans</p></li><li><p>Jets hand Dolphins their first win of the season</p></li></ul><p>Jaxon Smith-Njigba caught nine passes for 150 yards and a touchdown, and the Seattle Seahawks handed the Kansas City Chiefs their first loss of the season.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/25/nfl-roundup-sunday-football-scores\">Continue reading...</a>",
