      "easySummary": "<ul><li><p>Harlequins 33-15 Saracens</p></li><li><p>England fly-half marks 200th appearance in style</p></li></ul><p>Marcus Smith celebrated his 200th Harlequins match in magnificent style. Perhaps there is a danger, at times, of taking his immense talent for granted, but he was unstoppable here. A powerful visiting Saracens side barely got a look-in, with Smith reminding us all of his ability on the day <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/25/joe-marchant-recalled-to-england-training-squad-for-nations-championship\">Steve Borthwick named his England squad</a> for a packed November.</p><p>Smith’s sensational running, distribution and tactical kicking masterfully controlled Quins’ attack for a badly needed success. They were nought from three in the league and this was a vital result for reasons more important than Smith’s personal prestige.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/25/harlequins-saracens-prem-rugby-union-match-report\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian Sport, this report highlights developments in Sports.\n\nHeadline: \"Marcus Smith produces timely reminder of his class as Harlequins sink Saracens\"\n\n<ul><li><p>Harlequins 33-15 Saracens</p></li><li><p>England fly-half marks 200th appearance in style</p></li></ul><p>Marcus Smith celebrated his 200th Harlequins match in magnificent style. Perhaps there is a danger, at times, of taking his immense talent for granted, but he was unstoppable here. A powerful visiting Saracens side barely got a look-in, with Smith reminding us all of his ability on the day <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/25/joe-marchant-recalled-to-england-training-squad-for-nations-championship\">Steve Borthwick named his England squad</a> for a packed November.</p><p>Smith’s sensational running, distribution and tactical kicking masterfully controlled Quins’ attack for a badly needed success. They were nought from three in the league and this was a vital result for reasons more important than Smith’s personal prestige.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/25/harlequins-saracens-prem-rugby-union-match-report\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
