      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mvpccgsa-ag2y",
      "title": "Ouattara rescues point for Brentford as Hull maintain unbeaten home record",
      "description": "<p></p><p>Hull’s unbeaten home record remains intact but the Tigers have not tasted victory for seven games after this draw with Brentford.</p><p>The opening goal came courtesy of a 24th-minute Oli McBurnie penalty, awarded when Aaron Hickey flattened Tim Iroegbunam while trying to hook the ball away.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/25/hull-brentford-premier-league-match-report\">Continue reading...</a>",
