      "originalImageUrl": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/7867ab4f4944eae25e71b78333cf958d0e2d23eb/150_0_1398_1118/master/1398.jpg?width=1000&amp%3Bquality=85&amp%3Bauto=format&amp%3Bfit=max&amp%3Bs=5f2046c2a1f93920498f2f95a93f8fe4&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max",
