      "quickSummary": [
        "Official verified dispatch from ScienceDaily: \"New evidence suggests spinosaurus spent most of its life underwater\".",
        "Key Context: Millions of years after animals first conquered land, some took an extraordinary evolutionary U-turn and returned to the water. Using machine learning and thousands of fossil measurements, Yale scient.",
