      "quickSummary": [
        "Official verified dispatch from ScienceDaily: \"Glioblastoma breakthrough reveals how brain cancer cells become more aggressive\".",
        "Key Context: Scientists discovered that the thick, sticky fluid surrounding glioblastoma tumors can make brain cancer cells smaller, more flexible, and better at invading surrounding tissue. Even more troubling, s.",
