      "id": "art-mongabay-mvpcckaf-99yi",
      "title": "Mozambique safari operator wins conservation award at COP17",
      "description": "YEREVAN, Armenia — A Mozambican safari operator credited with helping restore wildlife populations in Mozambique’s Zambezi Delta, has won the 2026 Markhor Award, which recognizes contributions to conservation through sustainable wildlife management. Zambeze Delta Safaris, led by professional hunter Mark Haldane, received the award on Oct. 22, 2026, at the ongoing U.N. Biodiversity Conference, COP17, [&#8230;]",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://news.mongabay.com/short-article/2026/10/mozambique-safari-operator-wins-conservation-award-at-cop17",
