    {
      "id": "art-guardian_environment-mvpeg0up-47jw",
      "title": "In allowing coal expansion in the Hunter, Chris Minns is pouring fuel on the climate fire. His decision will come back to hurt us all | Jack Egan",
      "description": "<p>The high court found NSW is responsible for emissions from burning exported coal. What message does it send when the government can step in and bypass the law?</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2025/mar/10/sign-up-for-the-clear-air-australia-environment-newsletter-with-adam-morton?CMP=cvau_sfl\">Sign up for climate and environment editor Adam Morton’s free Clear Air newsletter here</a></p></li></ul><p>As someone who lost their home in the black summer bushfires, I was buoyed by the high court finding in favour of a small community group in the Hunter Valley earlier this month.</p><p>Led by two retired science teachers, Wendy Wales and Tony Lonergan, the Denman Aberdeen Muswellbrook Scone Healthy Environment Group <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/08/retired-hunter-valley-couple-mach-energy-mount-pleasant-coalmine-high-court\">took on a massive coal corporation and won</a>. As a fellow schoolteacher, I felt a particular sense of pride seeing these ordinary Australians act on their care for their community and future generations.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/commentisfree/2026/oct/23/chris-minns-coal-expansion-laws-will-hurt-us-all-climate-mount-pleasant\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/commentisfree/2026/oct/23/chris-minns-coal-expansion-laws-will-hurt-us-all-climate-mount-pleasant",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/commentisfree/2026/oct/23/chris-minns-coal-expansion-laws-will-hurt-us-all-climate-mount-pleasant",
      "publisherId": "guardian_environment",
      "creatorId": "guardian_environment",
      "creatorName": "The Guardian Environment",
      "creatorHandle": "@guardianeco",
      "creatorAvatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470071459604-3b5ec3a7fe05?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
      "platform": "news",
      "category": "Current Affairs",
      "currentAffairsCategory": "Science and Environment",
      "publishDate": "2026-10-23T01:08:49.000Z",
