    {
      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mvkhuamm-0yuw",
      "title": "Premier League: 10 things to look out for this weekend",
      "description": "<p>Bruno Fernandes owes Manchester United a performance, Mathys Tel has arrived at Spurs and Liverpool are improving</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/sep/10/premier-league-top-scorers-2026-27-race-for-golden-boot\"><strong>Premier League top scorers</strong></a></p></li></ul><p>Michael Carrick and Bruno Fernandes held clear-the-air talks this week. Fernandes was an unused substitute against Bournemouth after criticising Carrick’s tactics during the Champions League <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/21/como-manchester-united-champions-league-match-report\">defeat at Como</a> but it seems the situation has been resolved – for now. Dropping Fernandes did not do United any good against Bournemouth, <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/25/manchester-united-bournemouth-premier-league-match-report-michael-carrick\">who ran riot at Old Trafford</a>, and the captain is expected to return to the starting lineup for the trip to Chelsea. If that happens, he owes Carrick a performance. Fernandes has been poor this season and it is time he did his talking on the pitch. <strong>Jacob Steinberg</strong></p><p>Chelsea v Manchester United, Saturday 12.30pm (all times GMT)</p><p>Manchester City v Brighton, Saturday 3pm</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/30/premier-league-10-things-to-look-out-for-this-weekend\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/23/premier-league-10-things-to-look-out-for-this-weekend",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/23/premier-league-10-things-to-look-out-for-this-weekend",
      "publisherId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorId": "the_guardian_sport",
      "creatorName": "The Guardian Sport",
      "creatorHandle": "@guardiansport",
      "creatorAvatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461896836934-ffe607ba8211?w=120&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
      "platform": "news",
      "category": "Sports",
      "currentAffairsCategory": "Sports",
      "publishDate": "2026-10-22T23:01:52.000Z",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T23:01:52.000Z",
      "firstSeenAt": "2026-10-23T04:52:32.985Z",
      "lastCheckedAt": "2026-11-01T05:06:57.163Z",
