      "title": "Rugby's data revolution - can Moneyball be oval?",
      "description": "Top rugby clubs are increasingly turning to data when they plan their moves to recruit talent.",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-union/articles/c6kg7kejxvw5o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
