    {
      "id": "art-the_guardian_sport-mvkhuamq-yr38",
      "title": "Rookie Lendeborg jaws at ‘weak ass’ Dončić and admits he didn’t watch much NBA",
      "description": "<ul><li><p>Lendeborg takes issue with appeals for foul calls</p></li><li><p>Forward says he had limited exposure to league</p></li></ul><p>Golden State Warriors rookie Yaxel Lendeborg had an extraordinary NBA debut as he jawed with Luka Dončić and admitted he had largely been exposed to the league through highlights before turning professional.</p><p>Lendeborg was given the task of guarding the Los Angeles Lakers star for large parts of Wednesday’s game, which Dončić’s team won 127-105.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/22/rookie-lendeborg-jaws-at-weak-ass-doncic-and-admits-he-didnt-watch-much-nba\">Continue reading...</a>",
