      ],
      "easySummary": "<ul><li><p>Carrick expected to be in charge for Bournemouth game</p></li><li><p>Compensation could be obstacle for Aston Villa’s Emery</p></li></ul><p>Unai Emery and Julian Nagelsmann have emerged as leading targets to replace Michael Carrick as Manchester United’s head coach should the board decide on a change after the club’s poorest start to the season since 1986.</p><p>Carrick is expected to remain in place for Sunday’s visit of Bournemouth – he is due to hold his pre-game media conference on Friday – but the 45-year-old’s job is in the balance after two wins from 11 games this season.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/22/unai-emery-julian-nagelsmann-manchester-united-michael-carrick\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian Sport, this report highlights developments in Sports.\n\nHeadline: \"Emery and Nagelsmann are top targets if Manchester United sack Carrick\"\n\n<ul><li><p>Carrick expected to be in charge for Bournemouth game</p></li><li><p>Compensation could be obstacle for Aston Villa’s Emery</p></li></ul><p>Unai Emery and Julian Nagelsmann have emerged as leading targets to replace Michael Carrick as Manchester United’s head coach should the board decide on a change after the club’s poorest start to the season since 1986.</p><p>Carrick is expected to remain in place for Sunday’s visit of Bournemouth – he is due to hold his pre-game media conference on Friday – but the 45-year-old’s job is in the balance after two wins from 11 games this season.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/22/unai-emery-julian-nagelsmann-manchester-united-michael-carrick\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
