      "quickSummary": [
        "Official verified dispatch from Vox News & Explains: \"You’re supposed to get one free doctor’s visit every year. So why are so many Americans being charged?\".",
        "Key Context: After moving to West Virginia last year, Steve Kuo signed up for a new insurance plan that would cost him $500 a month. But there was one upside: He knew he was entitled to a free preventive visit. He.",
