      "title": "Iran says 7 oil tankers catch fire or damaged overnight in Strait of Hormuz",
      "description": "Iran’s state television reported that seven oil tankers have caught fire and were damaged overnight Thursday (October 22, 2026) after being targeted or striking naval mines in the Strait of Hormuz",
