      "easySummary": "<p>From experiencing racism growing up in Newcastle to becoming a derby hero and now a member of the executive team, the former striker has been on a remarkable journey</p><p>“There were times where I feared for my life as a kid, being harassed and chased by different groups of people,” Shola Ameobi says. “There were situations where I had to sprint to get away from groups of lads who didn’t like me because of what I looked like.”</p><p>Ameobi is recalling growing up in Newcastle during the late 1980s and 1990s, having moved from Nigeria aged six. There were lots of moments like that.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/22/shola-ameobi-interview-newcastle-united-derby-hero\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian Sport, this report highlights developments in Sports.\n\nHeadline: \"Shola Ameobi: ‘I thought: how can I be most useful to Newcastle? Then the cog started turning’\"\n\n<p>From experiencing racism growing up in Newcastle to becoming a derby hero and now a member of the executive team, the former striker has been on a remarkable journey</p><p>“There were times where I feared for my life as a kid, being harassed and chased by different groups of people,” Shola Ameobi says. “There were situations where I had to sprint to get away from groups of lads who didn’t like me because of what I looked like.”</p><p>Ameobi is recalling growing up in Newcastle during the late 1980s and 1990s, having moved from Nigeria aged six. There were lots of moments like that.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/oct/22/shola-ameobi-interview-newcastle-united-derby-hero\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
