      "id": "art-mit_tech_review-mvjly0wp-l904",
      "title": "We can do impossible things",
      "description": "I’d wager everyone has a rehearsed response to what’s absolutely one of the world’s worst interview questions: “What’s your biggest weakness?” Whenever I’ve gotten it, I take a slow—even pensive—breath and rattle off my line: “I say no to myself too much.”&#160; I won’t lie. It’s a bit shameless—a definite humblebrag. I’m a systems thinker:&#8230;",
