    {
      "id": "art-mit_tech_review-mvjly0xd-9l1m",
      "title": "Interspecies communication",
      "description": "Humans are far from the only species with a gift for gab, and our furry, feathered, and finned friends could have a lot to tell us. Decoding how animals communicate with one another could offer a window into the inner lives of other species and help humans realize that “animals are sentient creatures who think,&#8230;",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/10/21/1146124/interspecies-communication-impossible-issue",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/10/21/1146124/interspecies-communication-impossible-issue/",
