        "Official verified dispatch from ScienceDaily: \"Scientists discover a bizarre Jurassic “squid” unlike anything ever seen\".",
        "Key Context: Scientists have identified the “fattest” belemnite ever discovered, a bizarre, barrel-shaped squid relative that lived in Wyoming’s ancient seas 160 million years ago. The exceptionally rare fossils r.",
