      "easySummary": "<p>Home of National Hunt racing has undergone extensive work on its drainage system in preparation for new season</p><p>There is little chance to catch your breath as the racing seasons turn and six days on from <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/live/2026/oct/17/british-champions-day-at-ascot-champion-stakes-queen-elizabeth-ii-stakes-and-more-live\">Ascot’s exhilarating Champions Day</a> Cheltenham will open its gates on Friday for the first card of the 2026-27 campaign.</p><p>Racing will return to the spiritual home of National Hunt after an abrupt curtailment to Cheltenham’s latest season. That was to allow for extensive work on the track’s drainage system after <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/jan/26/cheltenhams-hole-in-the-track-an-unfortunate-postscript-after-sir-gino-setback\">the discovery of a significant hole</a> in the racing surface on Trials day in late January.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/19/cheltenham-jumps-into-action-after-fixing-its-troublesome-hole\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "detailedSummary": "Published by The Guardian Sport, this report highlights developments in Sports.\n\nHeadline: \"Cheltenham jumps into action after fixing its troublesome hole\"\n\n<p>Home of National Hunt racing has undergone extensive work on its drainage system in preparation for new season</p><p>There is little chance to catch your breath as the racing seasons turn and six days on from <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/live/2026/oct/17/british-champions-day-at-ascot-champion-stakes-queen-elizabeth-ii-stakes-and-more-live\">Ascot’s exhilarating Champions Day</a> Cheltenham will open its gates on Friday for the first card of the 2026-27 campaign.</p><p>Racing will return to the spiritual home of National Hunt after an abrupt curtailment to Cheltenham’s latest season. That was to allow for extensive work on the track’s drainage system after <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/jan/26/cheltenhams-hole-in-the-track-an-unfortunate-postscript-after-sir-gino-setback\">the discovery of a significant hole</a> in the racing surface on Trials day in late January.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/19/cheltenham-jumps-into-action-after-fixing-its-troublesome-hole\">Continue reading...</a>\n\nThe World Ledger maintains strict source attribution and preserves the publisher's original journalism without automated hallucination.",
