      "title": "The uranium cubes that exposed Nazi Germany’s nuclear failure",
      "description": "Scientists investigating Nazi Germany&#039;s secret nuclear program have uncovered evidence that its final experimental reactor was nowhere near as close to working as previously claimed. Analysis of surviving uranium cubes and wartime documents reveals that Germany lacked the enormous quantities of uranium and heavy water needed to make its reactor operational.",
