      "originalImageUrl": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/dc0441d99e158bcc614888c623997f70242554f1/170_0_3752_3001/master/3752.jpg?width=1000&amp%3Bquality=85&amp%3Bauto=format&amp%3Bfit=max&amp%3Bs=044fc190d1e94ef92fac096be88129c2&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max",
