      "description": "<p>Subscribe to our cricket newsletter for our writers’ thoughts on the biggest stories</p><p>Let our team of writers be your guide to the cricketing world, as they analyse the big stories, revisit the week’s matches and other happenings, and look further afield. Sign up below to start receiving The Spin in your inbox. View the latest edition <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/series/thespin/latest/email\">here</a>.</p><p>Try our other sports emails: there’s daily football news and gossip in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/info/2016/jan/05/the-fiver-email-sign-up\">The Fiver</a>, a weekly rugby union catch-up in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2016/aug/18/sign-up-to-the-breakdown\">The Breakdown</a>, and our seven-day round-up of the best of our sports journalism in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2017/may/15/the-recap-sign-up-for-the-best-of-the-guardians-sport-coverage\">The Recap</a>. <br></p><p>Living in Australia? Try the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/info/2015/jun/05/guardian-australia-sport-newsletter-subscribe-by-email\">Guardian Australia’s daily sports newsletter</a></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2016/aug/18/sign-up-to-the-spin\">Continue reading...</a>",
